      "post_id": "81193",
      "author_handle": "SAHM",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 5 months ago",
      "body": "Yeah I would stick with it.  Feeding more will increase your supply and make sure you are stay hydrated...lots of fluids!\nI agree with soup: also some people who have plently of milk to feed baby can not express a great deal of milk out - dont judge your milk supply by your expressed amounts\nAlso, as long as your LO weight is fine I would keep at it.\nGood Luck!",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-8574/#81193",
