    {
      "post_id": "81408",
      "author_handle": "Ladybug",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 5 months ago",
      "body": "Hello\nNot sure about the herbs hon, give up if they taste like that.\nIncrease supply by drinking plenty of fluids and having baby at your breast as often as possible.  If you start to top up with formula your supply will diminish further.\nFeed from one side, then the other, as much as the little mite will take.  Then try to express a couple of drops from each side.  Over time you wil be able to express a little more, thus increasing the production.\nDon't stick to a set feeding routine, feed on demand.\nHope this helps hon.",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-8574/#81408",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/078da8f3feeb9aaf31b6.html",
